{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04002","headline":"晦日宴高氏林亭 · 郎余令","name":"晦日宴高氏林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三春休晦节，九谷泛年华。\n半晴余细雨，全晚澹残霞。\n尊开疎竹叶，管应落梅花。\n兴阑相顾起，流水送香车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郎余令","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04002.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04002","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}